SCOPE: this repository is software plus its own machine-generated results,
and this MIT licence covers ALL of it, namely

    *.py                             the certified-spectral-map driver,
                                     bracket solver, Sturm counter,
                                     eigenvalue routes and their tests
    *.json, *.jsonl, *.sha256        the computed spectral results and the
                                     result manifest that pins them
    *.md                             the documentation that accompanies the
                                     code, including NOTES.md

Third-party material vendored inside the repository, if any, keeps its own
licence and is not relicensed by this file.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOTE ON SUBSTATIVE CLAIMS: this licence covers the software; it does not
endorse any conclusion drawn from its output. The code computes rigorous
eigenvalue brackets for the Guinand-Weil block matrix tau = W02 - WR - Wp by
interval and ball arithmetic. Producing a certified spectrum of an operator is
not a proof about the Riemann zeta function, and no such proof is asserted by
this repository.
